WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,790
I'm just talking about our horses

2
00:00:00,840 --> 00:00:02,320
They are all trained gentle breeds

3
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:03,680
How can you go crazy easily?

4
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:05,720
He must have taken the horse out on purpose.

5
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,520
He also used earrings to make the horse lose his temper due to pain.

6
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:08,680
Finally, the thief shouted "Catch the thief"

7
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:10,800
You're blaming me for this, you're talking nonsense

8
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,200
It's a shame that I still speak for you today

9
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,480
You actually hit me like this

10
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,200
You are obviously afraid of being fired

11
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,880
He deliberately slandered me

12
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:18,800
You said those earrings are mine, do you have proof?

13
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,840
I obviously saw the young master

14
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:23,040
This afternoon the sun was just right and he had one earlobe

15
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:31,250
Even if I was stupid for a moment, the evidence doesn’t mean that I don’t have this earring.

16
00:00:31,250 --> 00:00:33,170
It's a new luxury brand like Dijia's

17
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:34,850
Every product sold will be recorded in detail

18
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:35,930
Buyer’s identity information

19
00:00:35,930 --> 00:00:37,690
And enter this earring into the membership system

20
00:00:37,690 --> 00:00:39,010
Is it Miss Song?

21
00:00:39,010 --> 00:00:40,210
To the General Agent of Dijia Jinzhou

22
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:41,410
Make a call and check

23
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:44,350
Of course I'm not afraid of you checking, just

24
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:46,550
There is no need for Miss Song to worry about this. In fact,

25
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:48,030
I've already asked someone to check it this afternoon.

26
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:49,710
The owner of this earring really deserves to be offended

27
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:51,710
After all, he did it but didn’t dare to admit it.

28
00:00:51,710 --> 00:00:53,230
There's nothing weird behind the scenes, right?

29
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:55,380
What does this have to do with me

30
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:58,780
Now that I have found the owner of the earrings, congratulations. I have nothing else to do.

31
00:01:03,310 --> 00:01:04,950
Miss Song deliberately passed my horse

32
00:01:04,950 --> 00:01:05,870
Almost to my distinguished guest

33
00:01:05,870 --> 00:01:07,110
causing bodily harm

34
00:01:07,110 --> 00:01:08,390
I want to just leave like this

35
00:01:08,390 --> 00:01:09,430
It's dark and the road is far away

36
00:01:09,430 --> 00:01:10,550
I specifically contacted the police officer

37
00:01:10,550 --> 00:01:11,750
Come and pick you up in person

38
00:01:11,750 --> 00:01:13,190
Miss Song, why don't you wait a moment?

39
00:01:13,190 --> 00:01:14,750
Go to the police station and speak clearly.

40
00:01:14,750 --> 00:01:15,910
It's not too late to leave
